; Ours. After the crate's query, so these win on the same node. A field name
; written as a key in a struct expression or pattern is a `property`: a key
; written in code labels a value; data files keep `string.special.key`.
; Shorthand fields, field declarations and field access keep their
; highlights.

(field_initializer
  field: (field_identifier) @property)

(field_pattern
  name: (field_identifier) @property)
